From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:22:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] server: prefill a chat draft before the last word

POST /v1/prefill evaluates the chat except the last incomplete word and stops before sampling, so the slot holds a prefix of the finished prompt. A draft gives that slot up when other work is waiting.
---
 tools/server/server-context.cpp | 122 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tools/server/server-context.h   |   1 +
 tools/server/server-prefill.h   | 129 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/server/server-queue.cpp   |   5 ++
 tools/server/server-queue.h     |   4 +
 tools/server/server-task.h      |   1 +
 tools/server/server.cpp         |   3 +
 7 files changed, 263 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/server/server-prefill.h

